{"reviewId": "363182609_84hodn131", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "金砖国家的“去美元化”机制：\n1，贸易结算本币化\n中国与俄罗斯、巴西、阿联酋等的结算中，人民币使用率快速上升；\n俄罗斯能源几乎完全以人民币、卢布或卢比结算；\n金砖国家讨论建立“共同结算单位”（参考欧洲的ECU雏形）。\n2，储备结构重构\n金砖国家央行黄金储备总量占全球约30%，并在持续上升；\n部分成员削减美债持仓，增加黄金与非美元资产；\n新开发银行（NDB）开始发行本币债券。\n3，能源与资源定价权重建\n沙特、俄罗斯、阿联酋等核心能源国加入金砖；\n“石油人民币”与“黄金结算”逐步形成；\n能源出口国与制造国之间建立直接结算关系。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "金砖四国”很大意义上并没有超脱现有的世界产业分工链条，并成为真正的增量因素，仍然与世界经济周期同生死、共荣辱。", "range": "17046-17101", "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "363182609_84hodn131", "userVid": 363182609, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761795092, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 363182609, "name": "       ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-rbxn9E6mTegMEgduo2tQe10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 76220143, "name": "逍遥云", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM7kxTnMhW5EJs8rawnbia4Iw4tGLduIxVbQx3uojvLVG4A/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "逍遥云", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"co